{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1601.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f636ee7b60d225186dc01fc7af077769bc822978fc90ce07c1aa03781156fc00","ja":"瑞希ちゃん？\nあの、片付け勝負って……？","zh":"小瑞希？\n那个，收拾决胜负是……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1601.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"32e6309f2811023b13b091469b7d17f34abf03038a8a129a5a6a38311451a121","ja":"はい、私は左端から、萩原さんは右端からスタート。\n真ん中の段ボールに、先にたどり着いた方が勝ちです。","zh":"好的，我从最左边开始，萩原小姐从最右边开始。\n先到达正中间纸箱的人获胜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1601.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7503a65a56aef3332b6029b6d68ac3992bf42f8fd33d53b186c52368dd8e4248","ja":"えっと……ルールを聞いたわけじゃなくて。\nどうして勝負するのかなあって……。","zh":"那个……我并不是想问规则。\n只是在想为什么要分个胜负呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1601.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"13fdc12a34efc6815792bae544701bdfc3c67c406ff917d2c8f527f50199cab3","ja":"それは、競い合うことで、楽しく早く、\n作業を進められるのではないかと。","zh":"那是考虑到大家通过互相竞争，或许能更开心、\n更迅速地推进工作。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1601.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3d1a8db32758b014beb26aebd520874eb6e09f7707dd9acfde81c1b4829c3858","ja":"な、なるほど……そういうことなら、\n勝負してみよっか？","zh":"原、原来如此……既然是这样的话，\n要不要比试一下呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1601.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"da0fbf98db734d1f62465dfbb06010c4d67914ad74bda83fd2f904e98630896a","ja":"ぜひ。では、準備はいいですか？\nよーい……どん。","zh":"好的。那么，准备好了吗？\n各就各位……跑。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
